	(text "REVISION 2.0 CHANGES\n\n* Boost Converter (U1) reconfigured from 3.3V to 5.0V output \nto support inductive load (Pump).\n* Updated R10 to 900kΩ / R11 to 100kΩ for 5V feedback \nloop adjustment.\n* Corrected UVLO network (R8 changed to 910kΩ) for \nproper 3.0V battery cutoff protection.\n* Added dedicated 3.3V LDO regulator down-rail from \n5V line to isolate MCU/logic circuitry."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
